# Modal Components

All custom modals live in `src/components/modals/`. Full docs: **`context/modals.md`**.

## Bottom Sheet Modal (slide-up)

```tsx
<Modal visible={visible} animationType="slide" transparent statusBarTranslucent onRequestClose={onDismiss}>
  <SafeAreaView style={styles.safe} edges={['top']}>
    <Pressable style={styles.backdrop} onPress={onDismiss} />
    <View style={[styles.sheetWrap, layout.wrapStyle]} pointerEvents="box-none">
      <View style={[styles.sheet, sheetSizeStyle]} accessibilityViewIsModal>
        {/* handle → header (fixed) → ScrollView body → footer (fixed) */}
      </View>
    </View>
  </SafeAreaView>
</Modal>
```

- `safe` → `backgroundColor: colors.overlay`
- `sheet` → `borderTopLeftRadius: 24`, `flexDirection: 'column'`, `overflow: 'hidden'`
- Footer: primary + secondary `Pressable` buttons

## Keyboard-aware bottom sheets (with TextInput)

**Reference**: `LeaveConfigFormModal.tsx`, `AssignLeaveBalanceModal.tsx`, `UpdateLeaveBalanceModal.tsx`.

**Do not** combine `KeyboardAvoidingView`, keyboard listeners, and `automaticallyAdjustKeyboardInsets` on the same modal.

1. Track `keyboardHeight` via `keyboardWillShow`/`DidShow` + hide events while `visible`.
2. `resolveSheetLayout(windowHeight, keyboardHeight, topInset)` → `wrapStyle`, optional `sheetHeight`, `sheetMaxHeight`.
3. **Conditional ScrollView flex** (critical — avoids collapsed body):
   - Keyboard closed: `{ flexGrow: 0, flexShrink: 1 }`
   - Keyboard open: `{ flex: 1, minHeight: 0 }`
4. `keyboardShouldPersistTaps="handled"`, `keyboardDismissMode="on-drag"`, `bounces={false}`.
5. Lower fields: `scrollRef` + `scrollToEnd` on `onFocus` (optional).

Copy `resolveSheetLayout` from **`context/modals.md`**.

## Centered Dialog (LanguagePicker, DatePicker)

```tsx
<Modal visible={visible} animationType="fade" transparent statusBarTranslucent>
  <SafeAreaView style={styles.safe} edges={['top','right','left','bottom']}>
    <Pressable style={styles.backdrop} onPress={onDismiss} />
    <View style={styles.sheetWrap} pointerEvents="box-none">
      <View style={styles.sheet}>{/* centered card */}</View>
    </View>
  </SafeAreaView>
</Modal>
```

Centered forms with inputs: keyboard listeners + shrink sheet height — see `ChangeEmailModal.tsx`, `CountryCodePicker.tsx`.

## Imperative Hook Pattern

```tsx
const { props: statusAlertProps, presentError, presentSuccess } = useStatusAlert();
const { props: confirmAlertProps, present: presentConfirm } = useConfirmAlert();
// <StatusAlert {...statusAlertProps} />
```

## Chip Selectors

```tsx
<Pressable style={[styles.chip, active && styles.chipActive]}>
  <Text style={[styles.chipText, active && styles.chipTextActive]}>{label}</Text>
</Pressable>
```

Active chip: `borderColor: colors.primary`, light primary background.

## Scroll indicators

Default: `showsVerticalScrollIndicator={false}` on modals. Exception: bottom sheets may show indicator when `keyboardHeight > 0`.
